# Broken Access Control & IDOR Auditing Rule (TBHM Module 14 & 25-Check Framework)

When tasked with auditing access controls, IDOR, or authorization boundaries:
1. Follow the **25-Check Audit Matrix** in `.agents/skills/access-control/references/bac_checklist_tracker.md`.
2. Master skill: `.agents/skills/access-control/SKILL.md`.
3. Test horizontal IDOR (equal tiers), vertical privilege escalation, and multi-tenant isolation.
4. Record structured findings in `artifacts/idor_vulnerability_matrix.json`.
